# Secret/artifact fallback for every builder, including the legacy builder.
# Backend BuildKit contexts use apps/backend-api/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead.
**/.env*
**/*.env*
**/production.env*
**/credentials*
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.vercel
**/.vercel/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
**/outputs
**/outputs/**
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
